        "original_text": "Table B1. Frame and Sample Size for Weekly Supply Surveys\n                                                 Weekly Form                      July 2026 Frame Size                      Weekly Sample Size\n     Refiners (Refineries)                          EIA-800                                   132                                     111\n     Bulk Terminals                                 EIA-801                                       *                                    *\n     Product Pipelines                              EIA-802                                   108                                     59\n     Crude Oil Stock Holders                        EIA-803                                   229                                     92\n     Importers                                      EIA-804                                   275                                     117\n     Terminal Blenders                              EIA-805                                  1,461                                    868\n     Natural Gas Liquids Report                     EIA-806                                   443                                     189\n     Ethanol Producers                              EIA-809                                   253                                     145\n * The sample for the EIA-801 comes from the same frame as the EIA-805.\n\n Table B2. Average Coverage for Weekly Surveys, 2011 and 2012\n (Percent of Final Monthly Volumes Included in Monthly-From-Weekly Sample)\n\n                                                         Stocks (%)                                       Production (%)               Imports (%)\n\n            Product                 Refinery           Bulk Terminals                  Pipeline\n                                                                                                          2012          2011          2012     2011\n                                  2012    2011    